      en: "This high-performance synthetic stern tube lubricant is biodegradable and non-toxic, designed to operate under extreme temperatures and high-pressure conditions. Its advanced anti-wear technology extends system service life, while full compatibility with conventional lubricants allows it to replace petroleum-based oils.",
